{"subject": "KK Compass 2026-11-25｜幣 1 檔：TIA空｜美股 不動作", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#182024;max-width:640px;line-height:1.6\">\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5d686c\">KK Compass 2・2026-11-25 13:32（台北）</div>\n<div style=\"border:2px solid #182024;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0 4px\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:4px\">今天要做的事</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;margin:3px 0\">₿ TIA 做空（短線（4H））：進場約 0.32400，停損 0.35939，倉位 本金的 4%</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;margin:3px 0\">🇺🇸 美股：今晚不用動作</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#5d686c;margin-top:4px\">詳細設定（停損單、怎麼賣、買多少）在下面各區。</div></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;margin:18px 0 4px;padding:5px 10px;background:#e6e8e3;color:#182024;border-radius:4px\">大盤雷達</h2><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px\"><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">Nasdaq 100 期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">25,915.25</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-1.37%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">報價 11-25 13:22</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">S&amp;P 500 期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">7,159.00</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-0.81%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">報價 11-25 13:22</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">道瓊期貨</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">49,824.00</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-0.47%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">報價 11-25 13:22</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">Nasdaq 綜合</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">23,733.53</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-1.48%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\"></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">S&amp;P 500</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">7,201.09</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-0.50%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\"></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">道瓊</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">50,018.70</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#18865a;text-align:right\">+0.85%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\"></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">費城半導體</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">8,832.50</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#c43d35;text-align:right\">-7.88%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0;font-size:12px;color:#5d686c\">200 日線下 -19.2%</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d5d9d2\"><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;white-space:nowrap\">VIX 恐慌指數</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-family:Menlo,Consolas,monospace;text-align:right\">26.360</td><td style=\"padding:3px 10px 3px 0;font-